{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 3,
  "name": "水雷屯",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00384",
              "text": "屯。元，亨，利，贞。勿用，有攸往，利建侯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00384",
                "bodyParagraph": 320
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00385",
              "text": "象曰：云，雷，屯；君子以经纶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00385",
                "bodyParagraph": 321
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00387",
              "text": "屯卦。大吉大利，吉利的占卜。不利于出门。有利于建国封侯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00387",
                "bodyParagraph": 323
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00388",
              "text": "《象辞》说：屯的上卦为坎，坎为云，下卦为震，震为雷。云行于上，雷动于下，是屯卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于云雷，用云的恩泽，雷的威严来治理国事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00388",
                "bodyParagraph": 324
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00390",
              "text": "屯卦坎上震下，为坎宫二世卦。屯说明有困难，又象征动而逢险境，需刚毅果敢方为吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00390",
                "bodyParagraph": 326
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00392",
              "text": "万物始生，开始困难；先劳后逸，苦尽甘来。 得此卦者，身处困境，宜守不宜进，须多加辛苦努力，排除困难，方可通达，有初难后解之象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00392",
                "bodyParagraph": 328
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00394",
              "text": "时运：宜守不宜进。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00394",
                "bodyParagraph": 330
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00395",
              "text": "财运：创业维艰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00395",
                "bodyParagraph": 331
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00396",
              "text": "家宅：修缮住宅；初婚不和。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00396",
                "bodyParagraph": 332
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00397",
              "text": "身体：保存元气。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00397",
                "bodyParagraph": 333
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00399",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下震上坎）相叠，震为雷，喻动；坎为雨，喻险。雷雨交加，险象丛生，环境恶劣。“屯”原指植物萌生大地，万物始生，充满艰难险阻，然而顺时应运，必欣欣向荣。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00399",
                "bodyParagraph": 335
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00400",
              "text": "大象：屯者难也，万事欲进而不得进。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00400",
                "bodyParagraph": 336
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00401",
              "text": "运势：身处困境，步步为营，有初难后解之意。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00401",
                "bodyParagraph": 337
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00402",
              "text": "事业：起初多有不利，要知难而进，小心翼翼，勇往直前，灵活机动，可望获得大的成功，时机到来时一定要抓住，却也不得操之太急，且仍有困难，务必有他人相助，故平时应多施恩惠。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00402",
                "bodyParagraph": 338
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00403",
              "text": "经商：创业初期步履艰难，多有挫折。坚定信念最重要，不要为表面现象所迷惑，应积极进取，行动果断，打开出路。若仍无法摆脱困境，则应退守保全，等待机会，再展宏图。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00403",
                "bodyParagraph": 339
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00404",
              "text": "求名：积极争取，主动追求，可以成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00404",
                "bodyParagraph": 340
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00405",
              "text": "婚恋：好事多磨，忠贞纯洁，大胆追求，能够成功，婚姻美满。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00405",
                "bodyParagraph": 341
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00406",
              "text": "决策：初始困难，但若具有坚忍不拔的毅力和锲而不舍的奋斗精神，前途不可估量，但往往不为他人理解而陷于孤独苦闷，事业会因此处于困难状态，需要得到贤德之人的帮助才能摆脱。如能以乐观主义精神处世，能取得成就。第三卦哲学含义 易经》之中每一卦都是一种象征，都代表着很多具体的意义。乾象征天，坤象征地，乾象征父，坤象征母，等等。乾坤二卦被称为父母卦，二卦的交相变化产生宇宙间的万事万物，而屯卦做为第三卦，它就象征了事物的开始。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00406",
                "bodyParagraph": 342
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00407",
              "text": "《序卦》中说道：“盈天地之间者唯万物，故受之以屯。屯者，盈也；屯者，物之始生也。”充满天地之间的就是万物，所以接着出现的是屯卦。屯是盈满的意思，也是万物开始出生的意思。屯卦为难进之象，象征着起始阶段的艰难，也就是“万事开头难”。从卦象上看，这是因上卦为坎，坎代表着艰险、凶险。下卦想前行，但是受到坎卦的阻拦，要在艰难之中行进。本卦属于下下卦。民间卦象诗对此卦的描述：风刮乱丝不见头，颠三倒四犯忧愁，慢从款来左顺遂，急促反惹不自由。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00407",
                "bodyParagraph": 343
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0004"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00408",
              "text": "屯卦上卦为坎为水，下卦为震为雷，所以屯卦的整体卦象为水雷屯。也就是说水与雷组合，便是屯卦的象征含义。可是“屯”字表示的是幼苗的形象，而卦象却是水与雷，这之间有什么联系呢?原来，坎在上，代表云，震在下，代表雷，乌云出现了，又出现了雷声，自然就会下雨了。只有下雨，地上的植物才能够生长，幼苗才能够有长成的希望。可见“屯”这个卦名与卦画之间是珠联璧合结合的十分巧妙。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00408",
                "bodyParagraph": 344
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00411",
              "text": "初九。盘桓，利居贞，利建侯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00411",
                "bodyParagraph": 347
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00412",
              "text": "象曰：虽盘桓，志行正也；以贵下贱，大得民也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00412",
                "bodyParagraph": 348
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00414",
              "text": "初九：徘徊难进。这是有利于居住的卜问。巫遇此爻，有利于建国封侯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00414",
                "bodyParagraph": 350
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00415",
              "text": "《象辞》说：虽然徘徊难进，但志行贞正。初九居六二阴爻之下，象征以尊贵而俯顺于低贱，因而大得民心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00415",
                "bodyParagraph": 351
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00417",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，安分守己者则无忧，躁动者不利。做官的暂时未受到重用，坚守正道，好运可期。女命则为良妇而兴家。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00417",
                "bodyParagraph": 353
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00419",
              "text": "时运：欲进不进，坚守正道。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00419",
                "bodyParagraph": 355
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00420",
              "text": "财运：不利经商，可任用正人君子。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00420",
                "bodyParagraph": 356
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00421",
              "text": "家宅：安居于贵宅；婚嫁吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00421",
                "bodyParagraph": 357
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00422",
              "text": "身体：健康无虞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00422",
                "bodyParagraph": 358
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00424",
              "text": "初九爻动变得周易第8卦：水地比。这个卦是异卦（下坤上坎）相叠，坤为地，坎为水。水附大地，地纳河海，相互依赖，亲密无间。此卦与师卦完全相反，互为综卦。它阐述的是相亲相辅，宽宏无私，精诚团结的道理。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00424",
                "bodyParagraph": 360
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00426",
              "text": "我们看在屯卦里，一再强调“利建侯”，这是因为凡事开始的时候，也正是 困难的时候，需要求得别人的帮助才行。在刚开始做一件新的事情时，如果你觉 得没有把握，可以调整自己的目标和策略，向有经验的下级人员请教，对他们进 行“封赏”，既给他们一定的好处，也同时给他们的一定责任和义务，有如分封 诸侯一样，这样对你的事情很有利。占得此卦之人，有可能是处于困境之中，徘徊不前，不能发挥潜能，在这个 时候，不宜有所作为，应该呆在家里贞守德操。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00426",
                "bodyParagraph": 362
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00427",
              "text": "并要建立自己的威信，培养自己 的人脉关系，或者等自己有一定建树时，再出山大干一场。事业之初起步艰难， 难做出成绩，但仍能守正不阿，勇于进取，前途必有利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00427",
                "bodyParagraph": 363
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00428",
              "text": "《象》曰：虽磐桓，志行正也。以贵下贱，大得民也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00428",
                "bodyParagraph": 364
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00429",
              "text": "《象》曰：虽磐桓，志行正也。以贵下贱，大得民也。这句话的意思是说：虽然徘徊不前，但是前进的心意是正当的;尊贵而处于 卑贱之下，这样可以广泛得到百姓的支持。初爻告诉人们遇到困难不要气馁，要有前进之心，另外要注意“以贵下 贱”，也就是君王要善待臣子，领导要敬重下属，也就是要礼贤下士。占得此卦之人，可能被许多人推举去做什么事，或当领导、小头目。虽然你 自身有这样的能力，但是时机不利，你很难实现自己的愿望，可以说是壮志未畴。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00429",
                "bodyParagraph": 365
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00430",
              "text": "初九阳爻得位，就好比心怀大志而处 于下层岗位的员工。在《周易》中阳尊阴 卑，所以说初九爻是“以贵下贱”，即以尊 贵的身份来到低贱的位置上。在我们今天， 不能认为阳便代表男，阴便代表女。其实，每一个胸怀大志的人，都是尊贵的，因为 他或她的志气者可以使自己成为尊贵的人。这种胸怀大志的人处于低贱的岗位中，要 像磐石一样坚定，要像华表一样自立自强，只有这样才能成就大的事业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00430",
                "bodyParagraph": 366
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00433",
              "text": "六二。屯如邅如，乘马班如。匪寇婚媾，女子贞不字，十年乃字。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00433",
                "bodyParagraph": 369
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00434",
              "text": "象曰：六二之难，乘刚也；十年乃字，反常也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00434",
                "bodyParagraph": 370
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00436",
              "text": "六二：进退徘徊，骑马盘旋不前；来者并非盗寇，而是求婚的人。女子守正，不轻率许嫁，经过较长等待才得以成婚。这里“字”依所据古注作许嫁解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00436",
                "bodyParagraph": 372
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0005"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00437",
              "text": "《象辞》说：六二的困难与下承刚爻有关。“十年乃字，反常也”在此解作经历阻碍后恢复正常的婚配关系，“反常”不是现代汉语的异常之意。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00437",
                "bodyParagraph": 373
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0006"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00439",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，有婚嫁之喜事。做官的权柄日盛。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00439",
                "bodyParagraph": 375
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00441",
              "text": "时运：一时未成，十年可成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00441",
                "bodyParagraph": 377
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00442",
              "text": "财运：售出有困难，颇耗时日。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00442",
                "bodyParagraph": 378
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00443",
              "text": "家宅：是佳偶，但须等待。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00443",
                "bodyParagraph": 379
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00444",
              "text": "身体：保持运动习惯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00444",
                "bodyParagraph": 380
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00446",
              "text": "六二爻动变得周易第60卦：水泽节。这个卦是异卦（下兑上坎）相叠。兑为泽，坎为水。泽有水而流有限，多必溢于泽外。因此要有节度，故称节。节卦与涣卦相反，互为综卦，交相使用。天地有节度才能常新，国家有节度才能安稳，个人有节度才能完美。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00446",
                "bodyParagraph": 382
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00448",
              "text": "六二之所以会不这么不顺，《象》中这样解释道：六二之难，乘刚也。十年乃字，反常也。这句话的意思是说：六二的难局，是因为乘驾在刚爻之上；十年才可出嫁，最后一切回归正常。 从这一卦中，我们可以明白择偶的要点：不在于金钱，不在于地位，只在乎是不是意中人，只在乎他是不是胸怀大志有发展。所以这位有眼光的六二，终于在十年后，嫁给了事业有成的意中人——初九。从这一爻，女读者应当受到启发，懂得如何选择自己的意中人哦!",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00448",
                "bodyParagraph": 384
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00451",
              "text": "六三。即鹿无虞，惟入于林中。君子几不如舍。往吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00451",
                "bodyParagraph": 387
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00452",
              "text": "象曰：即鹿无虞，以纵禽也。君子舍之，往吝，穷也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00452",
                "bodyParagraph": 388
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00454",
              "text": "六三：追捕野鹿，没有充当向导的官员。思忖着鹿逃入山林。君子机灵，认为不如放弃。深入山林，认为会有危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00454",
                "bodyParagraph": 390
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00455",
              "text": "《象辞》说：追捕野鹿，没有充当向导的官员，意在追逐走兽。君子放弃那野鹿，知道深入山林会有危险，因而除此别无他法。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00455",
                "bodyParagraph": 391
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00457",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，须安分守己，否则会有灾难。做官的有贪污之嫌，有被停职降职之忧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00457",
                "bodyParagraph": 393
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00459",
              "text": "时运：求宝得利，殊不足取。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00459",
                "bodyParagraph": 395
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00460",
              "text": "财运：恐有损失，不如舍去。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00460",
                "bodyParagraph": 396
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00461",
              "text": "家宅：不循正途求婚嫁，将有困难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00461",
                "bodyParagraph": 397
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00462",
              "text": "身体：不可纵欲伤身。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00462",
                "bodyParagraph": 398
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00464",
              "text": "六三爻动变得周易第63卦：水火既济。这个卦是异卦（下离上坎）相叠。坎为水，离为火，水火相交，水在火上，水势压倒火势，救火大功告成。既，已经；济，成也。既济就是事情已经成功，但终将发生变故。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00464",
                "bodyParagraph": 400
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00466",
              "text": "我们仔细来看这一爻，六三在下卦之中，下卦属于震卦，而震代表的意思就是行动。六三又在互坤里，坤代表田地。从六三所处的位置，我们能分析出是在田猎。六三是阴爻，但是却居于“三”这个刚位之上，上面又没有领导，所以指示虽进入田林之中，但是却没有可听从的对象，没有人指挥他、引导他。而自己属于阴，又不具备这种能力。在这种情况下，不如舍弃追逐猎物，否则会遇到困难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00466",
                "bodyParagraph": 402
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00467",
              "text": "占得此爻者，做事时要学会见机而作，如果没有得力的助手帮忙，或者是领导的支持，自己又不擅长于此，就放弃吧，不要去做了。如果自己不是某一方面的人才，硬要做成某一方面的事，不仅事不成，还会带来灾咎。《象》中这样分析此爻：即鹿无虞，以从禽也。君子舍之，往吝，穷也。这句话的意思是说：追逐野鹿却没有猎官的带领，只是跟随禽兽来追，这是因为贪图禽兽而已。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00467",
                "bodyParagraph": 403
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00468",
              "text": "君子应该放弃，若是再往前追，就会有困难，甚至会陷入困 占得此爻者，在做事时要注意，有的事能做，天时地利人和，而且自己有能力做，自然该毫不犹豫地去做。有的事不能做，也无能力做，就是有金山银山放在面前，也不能去做。如果只贪图荣华富贵，不计能与不能，必有灾祸发生!遇以这样的情况时，应该当舍则舍，一定要控制住自己的贪念，不要只顾追逐猎物，而不顾自己的处境。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00468",
                "bodyParagraph": 404
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00469",
              "text": "六三爻处于震卦的最上面，震为行动，但处于最上面的六三难免会有行动过火的表现，并且再往上便进入了坎卦，坎便是险，前面有危险呀，所以爻辞用极其形象的比喻给予了十分中肯的忠告。君子追着一头鹿来到了森林中，这是一片陌生的森林，这位君子急于得到这只鹿，所以这次打猎没带有经验的猎官，于是面临迷路的危险。这可怎么办，继续追，还是放弃?这位君子是明智的，他选择了放弃。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00469",
                "bodyParagraph": 405
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00472",
              "text": "六四。乘马班如，求婚媾，往吉，无不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00472",
                "bodyParagraph": 408
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00473",
              "text": "象曰：求而往，明也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00473",
                "bodyParagraph": 409
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00475",
              "text": "六四：驾着马车原地回旋，这是寻求婿姻。放胆前进，必定吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00475",
                "bodyParagraph": 411
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00476",
              "text": "《象辞》说：敢于追求，勇于深入，因为其人深明形势。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00476",
                "bodyParagraph": 412
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00478",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，谋事可成，百事和合，会得到朋友的帮助，大吉大利。做官的将会名声显赫，有升迁之机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00478",
                "bodyParagraph": 414
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00480",
              "text": "时运：顺势而为，大有发展。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00480",
                "bodyParagraph": 416
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00481",
              "text": "财运：明见利益，应有收获。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00481",
                "bodyParagraph": 417
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00482",
              "text": "家宅：婚嫁吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00482",
                "bodyParagraph": 418
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00483",
              "text": "身体：遵医生嘱咐。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00483",
                "bodyParagraph": 419
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00485",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第17卦：泽雷随。这个卦是异卦（下震上兑）相叠，震为雷，为动；兑为悦，动而悦就是“随”。随指相互顺从，己有随物，物能随己，彼此沟通。随必依时顺势，有原则和条件，以坚贞为前提。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00485",
                "bodyParagraph": 421
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00491",
              "text": "九五。屯其膏，小贞吉，大贞凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00491",
                "bodyParagraph": 427
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00492",
              "text": "象曰：屯其膏，施未光也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00492",
                "bodyParagraph": 428
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00494",
              "text": "九五：屯积肥肉。筮遇此爻，问小事则吉，问大事则凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00494",
                "bodyParagraph": 430
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00495",
              "text": "《象辞》说：“屯积肥肉”，意思是施舍不广。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00495",
                "bodyParagraph": 431
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00497",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，谋事者切勿急躁，小事可成，大事无望，甚至会招来凶祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00497",
                "bodyParagraph": 433
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00499",
              "text": "时运：无人提拔，暂时无望。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00499",
                "bodyParagraph": 435
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00500",
              "text": "财运：小买卖尚可获利，大买卖则凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00500",
                "bodyParagraph": 436
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00501",
              "text": "家宅：聚财伤和气。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00501",
                "bodyParagraph": 437
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00502",
              "text": "身体：初病可治，久病则危。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00502",
                "bodyParagraph": 438
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00504",
              "text": "九五爻动变得周易第24卦：地雷复。这个卦是异卦（下震上坤）相叠。震为雷、为动；坤为地、为顺，动则顺，顺其自然。动在顺中，内阳外阴，循序运动，进退自如，利于前进。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00504",
                "bodyParagraph": 440
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00506",
              "text": "从卦象上看，六四属于阴爻居于柔位，得位。占得此爻者，若是想求婚，就不必犹豫不前，担心人家不喜欢自己或者是受到拒绝，不如大胆地前去追求，尽管这过程中看起来可能有困难和挫折，但是很吉利，并没有想像中那么多的困",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00506",
                "bodyParagraph": 442
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00507",
              "text": "《象》曰：求而往，明也。 这句话的意思是说：坚定不移地去追求，是明智之举。 此爻属于屯卦之中，喻示事物初生之际，面临困难是必然的，绝不能因此而灰心丧气，停下自己的脚步和追求。所以要抛开忧虑，去大胆追求。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00507",
                "bodyParagraph": 443
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00510",
              "text": "上六。乘马班如，泣血涟如。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00510",
                "bodyParagraph": 446
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00511",
              "text": "象曰：泣血涟如，何可长也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00511",
                "bodyParagraph": 447
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00513",
              "text": "上六：驾着马车原地回旋，哭泣无声，滴泪涟涟。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00513",
                "bodyParagraph": 449
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00514",
              "text": "《象辞》说：哭泣无声，滴泪涟涟，这种情景怎能长久下去。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00514",
                "bodyParagraph": 450
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00516",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，家道中落，须防损失。做官的须谨防小人的谗言。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00516",
                "bodyParagraph": 452
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00518",
              "text": "时运：前无去路，保命为要。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00518",
                "bodyParagraph": 454
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00519",
              "text": "财运：犹豫不决，尽失良机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00519",
                "bodyParagraph": 455
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00520",
              "text": "家宅：家道中落。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00520",
                "bodyParagraph": 456
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00521",
              "text": "身体：呕血之症，凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00521",
                "bodyParagraph": 457
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00523",
              "text": "上六爻动变得周易第42卦：风雷益。这个卦是异卦（下震上巽）相叠。巽为风；震为雷。风雷激荡，其势愈强，雷愈响，风雷相助互长，交相助益。此卦与损卦相反。它是损上以益下，后者是损下以益上。二卦阐述的是损益的原则。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00523",
                "bodyParagraph": 459
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00525",
              "text": "我们知道，在《易经》之中，是以九五位为尊的。九五居坎卦之中，坎代表云。云是聚集的水滴，尚未转化成雨，所以说“屯其膏”。如果是天子占得此卦，表示天子的恩泽未能广布。天子应懂得舍得之道，自己存的财物少，施给老百姓的多，则就会吉利。反之，则凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00525",
                "bodyParagraph": 461
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00526",
              "text": "《象》曰：“屯其膏”，施未光也。 这里指出：“只顾自己囤积财富而不注意帮助别人”，这样的人即使想有所作为，其前景也不大光明。 若是普通人占得此卦，你要懂得取舍之道。只顾自己囤积财富而不注意帮助别人，是很危险的，那样做，办小事虽有成功的可能，但办大事则必然会出现凶险。所以，不要光盯着自己的钱口袋，要“广施恩泽”，懂得舍，才能避凶趋吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00526",
                "bodyParagraph": 462
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 2
}
